      "name": "AI-Native SAFe Certification",
      "description": "Implementing SAFe's AI-Native certification across three role-aligned tracks (Practitioner, Release Train Engineer, Transformation Lead), six modules, and a 90-day cohort cadence for building the AI-native operating model inside a scaled-agile enterprise.",
